<title>USA: Handleman names Thomas Oviatt treasurer.</title>
<headline>Handleman names Thomas Oviatt treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Handleman Co said it named Thomas Oviatt vice president and treasurer.</p>
<p>Oviatt was formerly executive vice president and treasurer of Ralcorp Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>Oviatt replaces Larry Edwards, who retired as treasurer at the end of last year, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
